# File phai giong nhau tren may chay Linux, khong duoc phai chay CRLF.
#
# Script shell va SQL chay tren may chay that (Ubuntu). CRLF trong deploy.sh lam
# bash bao loi "bad interpreter"; CRLF trong file SQL ma PostgreSQL doc lai
# khong sao, nhung SQL neu them tu khoa `\` o cuoi dong se hong.
#
# Repo dung core.autocrlf=true nen file do mo tren Windows se CRLF. Khai bao
# o day de Git luôn luu LF trong index, bat ke ai edit tren may nao.
* text=auto

*.sh    text eol=lf
*.sql   text eol=lf
*.yml   text eol=lf
*.yaml  text eol=lf

# File nhi phai giu nguyen byte (khong dung chua nhin doi dong)
*.docx      binary
*.png       binary
*.jpg       binary
*.wav       binary
*.m4a       binary